{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんおはようございます！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に6月！\n今月はofficialカレンダーを\n真夏さんとまあやと3人で\n担当してますので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ捲ってない！って方は\nお早めに捲って下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわ系に仕上がっております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n予告通り自己紹介ブログを\nお届けしますo(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど今日握手会だから、\n初めましての方も\nいつもましての方も\n改めて私のことを知ってくれたら\n嬉しいです♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロフィール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃名前  新内眞衣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃愛称  まいちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃出身  埼玉県"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃血液型  B型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃身長  164.5cm"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#足  23cm"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃生年月日  1992/1/22 (23)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃星座  みずがめ座"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃干支  申年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃職業 アイドル 会社員"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃趣味 映画鑑賞 読書 路線図を見ること\nカフェ巡り 岩盤浴"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃特技 東京メトロの色あて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなもの編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃色  白 黒 青 紫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃食べ物  納豆 お寿司 しゃぶしゃぶ 乾き物"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃スイーツ  チョコレート アイスクリーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃飲み物  炭酸水 フルーツスムージー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃服  COCODEAL MERCURYDUO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃靴  REZOY RANDA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃ドラマ  やまとなでしこ LIARGAME\nランチの女王 アットホームダッド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃音楽  ELLEGARDENさん 宇多田ヒカルさん\nCHEMISTRYさん aikoさん\nback numberさん等"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃場所  東京タワー 皇居外苑 北海道\nディズニーシー 丸の内"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃乗り物  飛行機 電車"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共通点はあったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからは来ていた質問に\n答えます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも写真しか見ないでスクロールしちゃう人は\n気になりそうなワードを赤くしたので\n気になった質問だけでも読んでみてね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝起きてから必ず何かすること\nありますか？(みなと@乃木坂神推しさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→寝た状態のまま手と足を空中に\n上げてブラブラさせる体操！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"血液が回る気がするの(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣は今年着てくれますか？\n(りょうじゅん「ニヤニヤ君」さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→まだ何も考えてなかったけど\n着るつもりだよ〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着て欲しい色とかあるかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんの使ってるメイク道具とか\nメイクのやり方を教えて下さい！\n美脚のためにやってることとか\n使ってるクリームとか\n女の子向けの記事を書いて欲しいです！\n(まゆげ⊿さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もう少しリクエストが\nあれば書こうかな〜〜V(^_^)V\nでもみんな知りたいのかな、、、？\nまたコメント来たら書いてみるね♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのストレス発散法は？\n(こめちゃんさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→甘いものとしょっぱいものを\n交互に食べて永遠ループすること！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後は、信頼できる人にとことん話を\n聞いてもらうことかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前者は1人でも出来るけど\n後者は1人じゃ出来ないから、\n大人になるにつれて難しくなるんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人っ子で得したことは？\n(箱推しさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→テレビのチャンネルを独占出来たこと\n夜ご飯何食べたい？が大体通ること\n1人遊びが必然的に得意になること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな〜〜♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人っ子って昔は寂しかったけど\n今は姉妹みたいなメンバーが\nたくさん居るので幸せです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの時、自分の団扇とかタオルって\n見つけたらどんな気持ちになりますか？\n(ブー⊿おきまるさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→びっくりするし、凄い嬉しい！\n見てくれてる人がいるんだ！\nってとても幸せな気分になります♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくれて\nありがとうm(_ _)m！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメンは醤油派ですか\n味噌派ですか塩派ですか？\n(みおさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→味噌派です。\n魚介豚骨と鶏白湯も捨てがたいっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初任給は何に使いましたか？\n(すうさんさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→家族とご飯へ行ってご馳走しました。\n定番かな〜〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん心配かけてたからこそ\n凄く喜んでくれたよ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな野菜は何ですか？\n(かいわれ大根さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→玉ねぎと胡瓜と大根とさつま芋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野菜大好きV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんは犬派？猫派？\n(生写真がよく出るいっくんさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→犬派かな〜。\nでも子猫の可愛いさも犯罪級\nなんだよな〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結論:どっちも好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから10年後の自分の姿は\nどうなりそう？(Tiyoさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→33歳か〜〜。\n1年後の未来もわからないくらいだから\n10年後なんて考えも付かないけど、\n自分の好きなことをしていたいなって\n思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲を言えば、乃木坂46でやってきたことを\n活かせる仕事をしていたい！\nそしてファンの方も然り、\n今乃木坂と関わってくれている方と\nずっとお仕事が出来たらなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも結婚はしてないだろうな、きっと笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、\n今日はここまでです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん質問してくれて本当に\n嬉しかったし、\nどれを選ぼうか迷いましたV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またちょくちょく質問返しするから\nいつでも気になったことは\n聞いてみて下さいね〜〜♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらつらと書いてきましたが、\nまた少し私のことを知ってくれた人が\n増えたら嬉しいです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張るぞ〜〜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/07/2626463/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！また書きます！"}],"source":"archive"}